    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2972110/extras/38a39dedf0427fbe5047cb5c93a8de5c.poster.avif?t=1742942791\" width=656 height=370 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2972110/extras/38a39dedf0427fbe5047cb5c93a8de5c.webm?t=1742942791\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2972110/extras/38a39dedf0427fbe5047cb5c93a8de5c.mp4?t=1742942791\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >ABOUT</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Homespun is a game about a cat going on an unknown adventure made entirely out of felt! Inspired by handmade crafts, the visuals are painstakingly crafted with the same techniques used in real world felt.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Features</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A handmade art style inspired by crafts. </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >3\u00a0 locations to explore.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >5 hazards to avoid.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Beat your high score and compete against the global leaderboards.</p></li></ul>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2972110/extras/38a39dedf0427fbe5047cb5c93a8de5c.poster.avif?t=1742942791\" width=656 height=370 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2972110/extras/38a39dedf0427fbe5047cb5c93a8de5c.webm?t=1742942791\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2972110/extras/38a39dedf0427fbe5047cb5c93a8de5c.mp4?t=1742942791\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >ABOUT</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Homespun is a game about a cat going on an unknown adventure made entirely out of felt! Inspired by handmade crafts, the visuals are painstakingly crafted with the same techniques used in real world felt.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Features</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A handmade art style inspired by crafts. </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >3\u00a0 locations to explore.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >5 hazards to avoid.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Beat your high score and compete against the global leaderboards.</p></li></ul>",
    "short_description": "Go on an adventure in a felt world! Homespun is made entirely out of real world felt lovingly crafted by just two artists.",
